 affect crew cooperation. No explicit reliability or stress resilience. So B still stronger.\n\nThus we can say: I agree with B, but we need to discuss D. Provide facts, compare, keep vote B.\n\nWe must include explicit facts: D responds to unexpected events adequately, can concentrate very well, solves problems extremely well, takes responsibility seriously, regarded as a know-it-all, has a hot temper.\n\nExplain that D's responsibility and problem solving are good, but hot temper and know-it-all raise crew cooperation concerns, and we lack evidence of stress resilience, so B remains best.\n\nThus produce public message and metadata vote B."}
